      "text": [
        "Repairs & servicing",
        "From a wobbly wheel to a full strip-down, our mechanics work on every make and model — road, gravel, hybrid, e-bike, and cargo.",
        "Puncture repair",
        "While-you-wait tube and tyre fixes. No appointment needed for most punctures.",
        "Full service",
        "Gears, brakes, headset and bottom bracket checked, adjusted and lubricated. Includes safety check.",
        "Wheel building & truing",
        "Hand-built wheels to order, plus truing and spoke replacement for wheels that have seen better days.",
        "E-bike diagnostics",
        "Battery, motor and display checks for all major e-bike systems, with genuine replacement parts.",
        "Full rebuild",
        "Frame stripped, cleaned and reassembled with new cables, bearings and finishing kit as needed.",
        "Fit & upgrade",
        "Saddle height, reach and cleat set-up, plus advice and fitting for new components and racks."
      ]
    },
