        "New models from trusted brands, plus fully reconditioned second-hand bikes — every one safety-checked and covered by our workshop guarantee.",
        "Thornbury City Hybrid",
        "Lightweight aluminium frame, hub gears and mudguards fitted — built for Oxford's cobbles and cycle lanes.",
        "Merrifield Audax",
        "Steel-framed endurance road bike with disc brakes and a relaxed geometry for long rides out to the Cotswolds.",
